(6524837, 970611, 136989, '<td valign="top">Maybe a different crop? Black/dead space distracts from effect.  However I did want to jump to his defense and say "I am not ignorant" so I guess something works. ;)</td>', 'Maybe a different crop? Black/dead space distracts from effect.  However I did want to jump to his defense and say "I am not ignorant" so I guess something works. ;)', '2011-09-02 12:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
