(6524878, 970743, 10785, '<td valign="top">Straight from a dream! LI like what you did here. The only thing I can think of to critique would be the edge of the man cutout on the background. The back lighting on the man doesn''t fit with the lighting in the background scene.</td>', 'Straight from a dream! LI like what you did here. The only thing I can think of to critique would be the edge of the man cutout on the background. The back lighting on the man doesn''t fit with the lighting in the background scene.', '2011-09-02 13:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6524882, 969517, 69034, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this is going to "crack" a high score.  But It does make me laugh my ass off (no pun intended).</td>', 'I don''t think this is going to "crack" a high score.  But It does make me laugh my ass off (no pun intended).', '2011-09-02 13:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
