(6525117, 970600, 124815, '<td valign="top">Another exercise done in so many ways. I though that Chuck Close put an end to it but, as exercises go, they''re always useful.<br/>No mark</td>', 'Another exercise done in so many ways. I though that Chuck Close put an end to it but, as exercises go, they''re always useful.No mark', '2011-09-02 15:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
