(6525121, 970072, 124815, '<td valign="top">A good one here. Truly the rule of thirds applied and all of it.</td>', 'A good one here. Truly the rule of thirds applied and all of it.', '2011-09-02 15:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525131, 969472, 124815, '<td valign="top">That''s an uncanny picture. If the title is true, I am at odds of the fact it''s published. <br/>The eyes only, without the close up, would have said it all, without any title. <br/>But I am probably totally wrong. It''s in this  context, in a DP challenge,  that I feel bad having to look at this man in the most horrible pain. We look plenty at wars, the known and unknown. it''s a great picture but ....</td>', 'That''s an uncanny picture. If the title is true, I am at odds of the fact it''s published. The eyes only, without the close up, would have said it all, without any title. But I am probably totally wrong. It''s in this  context, in a DP challenge,  that I feel bad having to look at this man in the most horrible pain. We look plenty at wars, the known and unknown. it''s a great picture but ....', '2011-09-02 15:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525136, 970338, 124815, '<td valign="top">A good  illustration done by a virtuoso. Remains an illustration for me. A portrait is a different thing. No mark</td>', 'A good  illustration done by a virtuoso. Remains an illustration for me. A portrait is a different thing. No mark', '2011-09-02 16:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525147, 970211, 124815, '<td valign="top">Absolutely splendid. More so since it has a child as main character. Who needs to see all the cute babies in the world? The family and friends only. Or in a challenge requiring that.<br/>But this is a great candid, a great catch, and great  processing. The allure of the child, the moment when the father turned his head ... You can almost hear the silence, the bumbled question, the barber in stop motion. This IS NOT A BABY PICTURE and applaud you for that.<br/>Yes, a 10</td>', 'Absolutely splendid. More so since it has a child as main character. Who needs to see all the cute babies in the world? The family and friends only. Or in a challenge requiring that.But this is a great candid, a great catch, and great  processing. The allure of the child, the moment when the father turned his head ... You can almost hear the silence, the bumbled question, the barber in stop motion. This IS NOT A BABY PICTURE and applaud you for that.Yes, a 10', '2011-09-02 16:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525148, 970635, 124815, '<td valign="top">This is truly a great family picture. That''s it. No mark</td>', 'This is truly a great family picture. That''s it. No mark', '2011-09-02 16:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525152, 970316, 124815, '<td valign="top">I can almost see it on tv for a Crest ad! An illustration done well but less of an artistic shot.</td>', 'I can almost see it on tv for a Crest ad! An illustration done well but less of an artistic shot.', '2011-09-02 16:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525154, 969854, 124815, '<td valign="top">You left me speechless here. Which is usually a good sign. I see no use of it as a photo BUT it''s important as a document. Yes, the document of the incomplete metamorphosis! (and an exercise in expert editing)<br/>The expression of the man is wonderful, especially the one in the background. The metamorphosis did not take away his poise. It''s the surprised look that we have at ourselves when we grow old.<br/>Bump up to 9</td>', 'You left me speechless here. Which is usually a good sign. I see no use of it as a photo BUT it''s important as a document. Yes, the document of the incomplete metamorphosis! (and an exercise in expert editing)The expression of the man is wonderful, especially the one in the background. The metamorphosis did not take away his poise. It''s the surprised look that we have at ourselves when we grow old.Bump up to 9', '2011-09-02 16:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6525157, 970618, 124815, '<td valign="top">You told his story very well. The barman is a listener.<br/>Bump up</td>', 'You told his story very well. The barman is a listener.Bump up', '2011-09-02 16:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
