(6526650, 970635, 10785, '<td valign="top">I love the happy smile on the dad and the processing is rich and well done!</td>', 'I love the happy smile on the dad and the processing is rich and well done!', '2011-09-03 20:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6526651, 969854, 10785, '<td valign="top">The sad emotion of this is contradictory to the colorful nature of the picture which aids in telling the story of the incomplete metamorphosis. It gives a feeling of regret for past actions or of the person missing something.</td>', 'The sad emotion of this is contradictory to the colorful nature of the picture which aids in telling the story of the incomplete metamorphosis. It gives a feeling of regret for past actions or of the person missing something.', '2011-09-03 20:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6526653, 970723, 10785, '<td valign="top">A very good self study. I think the artistic filter used goes along well with the emotion portrayed in the shot. B&amp;W was a great choice! Really good details in the eyes and face.</td>', 'A very good self study. I think the artistic filter used goes along well with the emotion portrayed in the shot. B&W was a great choice! Really good details in the eyes and face.', '2011-09-03 20:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6526654, 970668, 10785, '<td valign="top">The steam looks like a goatee!! Cool! I think this has great character and I like the B&amp;W tones and the lighting!</td>', 'The steam looks like a goatee!! Cool! I think this has great character and I like the B&W tones and the lighting!', '2011-09-03 20:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6526655, 970611, 10785, '<td valign="top">Clean cut, rugged and manly! I like the subtle Rembrandt lighting.</td>', 'Clean cut, rugged and manly! I like the subtle Rembrandt lighting.', '2011-09-03 20:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6526656, 970654, 10785, '<td valign="top">Cute little man! Good DoF and focus used. Nice color, especially with the pink baby skin.</td>', 'Cute little man! Good DoF and focus used. Nice color, especially with the pink baby skin.', '2011-09-03 20:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6526657, 970429, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think this is a good capture. Two things to check out in this photo. I think you were bold in getting this candid without attracting attention however I would have to say to get closer for better effect. Also the rule of thirds would be a good compositional technique here putting the man in the left hand third and allowing the line of the path to take you trough the photo. All in all it is good but could be improved.</td>', 'I think this is a good capture. Two things to check out in this photo. I think you were bold in getting this candid without attracting attention however I would have to say to get closer for better effect. Also the rule of thirds would be a good compositional technique here putting the man in the left hand third and allowing the line of the path to take you trough the photo. All in all it is good but could be improved.', '2011-09-03 20:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6526658, 970653, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think you have a really great photo here and I am assuming it is a family member or friend. I want to comment a little on the props used. I think they have a little bit of conflict. It looks like the young man is geared up to go white water rafting or something adventurous like that. And the grin on his face looks like he is tough and rugged. But then you have the shark pool toy which really conflicts and changes the message of the portrait. I hope I wasn''t being offensive or anything giving that critique. If you were showing a funny moment or a funny side of the person, then I am missing that and it is my fault.<br/> <br/>Other than that I think the color is great and the lighting is good along with the Depth of field used.</td>', 'I think you have a really great photo here and I am assuming it is a family member or friend. I want to comment a little on the props used. I think they have a little bit of conflict. It looks like the young man is geared up to go white water rafting or something adventurous like that. And the grin on his face looks like he is tough and rugged. But then you have the shark pool toy which really conflicts and changes the message of the portrait. I hope I wasn''t being offensive or anything giving that critique. If you were showing a funny moment or a funny side of the person, then I am missing that and it is my fault. Other than that I think the color is great and the lighting is good along with the Depth of field used.', '2011-09-03 20:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
