(6533444, 970674, 125275, '<td valign="top">I really like the set up and processing of this image. The blending and lighting are superb. The smoke and liquid look awesome.<br/>With the positioning of the smoke under the model, it almost looks like a tutu at first glance (which may say more about me than the image), I wonder if perhaps a bit of shading or visible cloth around the torso might lessen this initial illusion. <br/>The clarity of the glass and liquid is great, but the blending near the fingers looks a *bit* artificial. Perhaps some light contact shadows around the fingers would add a bit of realism. (I see the same issue at the bottom of the can. A contact shadow at the very bottom of the can would reduce the "floating" illusion it currently has.)<br/>I realize this is not a photoshop contest, but I am only leaving such a huge comment because I think this blending and composition is already really good, and could benefit from these small changes. This got a high score from me and will likely be on the front page. Well done!</td>', 'I really like the set up and processing of this image. The blending and lighting are superb. The smoke and liquid look awesome.With the positioning of the smoke under the model, it almost looks like a tutu at first glance (which may say more about me than the image), I wonder if perhaps a bit of shading or visible cloth around the torso might lessen this initial illusion. The clarity of the glass and liquid is great, but the blending near the fingers looks a *bit* artificial. Perhaps some light contact shadows around the fingers would add a bit of realism. (I see the same issue at the bottom of the can. A contact shadow at the very bottom of the can would reduce the "floating" illusion it currently has.)I realize this is not a photoshop contest, but I am only leaving such a huge comment because I think this blending and composition is already really good, and could benefit from these small changes. This got a high score from me and will likely be on the front page. Well done!', '2011-09-08 15:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6533446, 969787, 125275, '<td valign="top">So...<img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=48928" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Sunshine86</a>? This is great processing and a great idea. I''m curious to read about your execution after the challenge. I think you could very well be on the front page.</td>', 'So... Sunshine86? This is great processing and a great idea. I''m curious to read about your execution after the challenge. I think you could very well be on the front page.', '2011-09-08 16:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6533447, 970628, 125275, '<td valign="top">Very simple idea and nicely executed. This is a nice use of expert editing and fits well into the "portrait" aspect of the challenge.</td>', 'Very simple idea and nicely executed. This is a nice use of expert editing and fits well into the "portrait" aspect of the challenge.', '2011-09-08 16:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6533448, 970668, 125275, '<td valign="top">This is my highest rated, least photoshopped image. It''s awesome lighting, posing and perspective. Cool shot!</td>', 'This is my highest rated, least photoshopped image. It''s awesome lighting, posing and perspective. Cool shot!', '2011-09-08 16:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6533450, 970670, 125275, '<td valign="top">Very creative. I tried to count how many unique hand shots this must have taken, must have been quite a bit of time in pre- and post-processing. Knowing the DPC crowd, this is likely to be the blue.</td>', 'Very creative. I tried to count how many unique hand shots this must have taken, must have been quite a bit of time in pre- and post-processing. Knowing the DPC crowd, this is likely to be the blue.', '2011-09-08 16:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6533454, 970316, 125275, '<td valign="top">This is a great setup and idea. My suggestion would be to reduce the redness of his skin, and perhaps use a more "expressive" face. Still, this is hilarious and very well executed.</td>', 'This is a great setup and idea. My suggestion would be to reduce the redness of his skin, and perhaps use a more "expressive" face. Still, this is hilarious and very well executed.', '2011-09-08 16:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6533455, 970600, 125275, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting and creative shot. I think that it might be a bit improved if you were to take your mesh layer and warp it a bit more to the contours of the model''s face. I would also possibly try to increase the sharpening/detail of the face, it looks a bit soft. Still, this is highly original and well done!</td>', 'This is a very interesting and creative shot. I think that it might be a bit improved if you were to take your mesh layer and warp it a bit more to the contours of the model''s face. I would also possibly try to increase the sharpening/detail of the face, it looks a bit soft. Still, this is highly original and well done!', '2011-09-08 16:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6533456, 969655, 125275, '<td valign="top">This is a cool portrait and I like the energy. The skin looks very "soft," but I imagine that is the look you were going for.</td>', 'This is a cool portrait and I like the energy. The skin looks very "soft," but I imagine that is the look you were going for.', '2011-09-08 16:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6533471, 970637, 125275, '<td valign="top">This is one of my highest rated "advanced editing" portraits. Very nice colors and tones.</td>', 'This is one of my highest rated "advanced editing" portraits. Very nice colors and tones.', '2011-09-08 16:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6533487, 969984, 125275, '<td valign="top">Very nice complementary colors and a unique take on the challenge. Having him in this pose and composition really adds to the "personality" of this image.</td>', 'Very nice complementary colors and a unique take on the challenge. Having him in this pose and composition really adds to the "personality" of this image.', '2011-09-08 16:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6533502, 970338, 125275, '<td valign="top">This has great colors and effects. Very interesting approach and I really like the spiked background.</td>', 'This has great colors and effects. Very interesting approach and I really like the spiked background.', '2011-09-08 17:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6533503, 969804, 125275, '<td valign="top">Very cool effects and perspective. Nice feeling in this portrait.</td>', 'Very cool effects and perspective. Nice feeling in this portrait.', '2011-09-08 17:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6533504, 969862, 125275, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and use of B&amp;W. The contrast and cropping are also good. Nice shot!</td>', 'Nice lighting and use of B&W. The contrast and cropping are also good. Nice shot!', '2011-09-08 17:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6533520, 970654, 125275, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Nice capture of the eyes, and cute expression.</td>', 'Beautiful! Nice capture of the eyes, and cute expression.', '2011-09-08 17:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
