(6533538, 969517, 125275, '<td valign="top">Classic. I don''t know if your editing is making "it" pop or if the picture was naturally like that but whichever it is, it''s hilarious!</td>', 'Classic. I don''t know if your editing is making "it" pop or if the picture was naturally like that but whichever it is, it''s hilarious!', '2011-09-08 17:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6533542, 970723, 125275, '<td valign="top">Interesting painterly effect. I like the colors and pose by itself and wonder if the picture would be stronger if it was done without that effect. I might lighten the eyes a bit and stay with sepia and I think it''d be a great and very interesting portrait.</td>', 'Interesting painterly effect. I like the colors and pose by itself and wonder if the picture would be stronger if it was done without that effect. I might lighten the eyes a bit and stay with sepia and I think it''d be a great and very interesting portrait.', '2011-09-08 17:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6533543, 970072, 125275, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture. I wonder what he is saying to make the people laugh! I think the person in the very front is a bit distracting, but it does offer a bit of perspective so it''s probably better that you left it in.</td>', 'Interesting capture. I wonder what he is saying to make the people laugh! I think the person in the very front is a bit distracting, but it does offer a bit of perspective so it''s probably better that you left it in.', '2011-09-08 17:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
