(6534132, 970670, 30861, '<td valign="top">Gonna bump this. From 7 to 10. The more I look at it, the more intrigued I am. It''s quite mesmerizing.</td>', 'Gonna bump this. From 7 to 10. The more I look at it, the more intrigued I am. It''s quite mesmerizing.', '2011-09-09 00:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6534142, 970706, 125275, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting idea. If your source image were a bit more recognizable (perhaps it is on the larger version?), it might be a bit stronger. Also, on a more subtle note, I''d consider leaving the whites of his eyes white and untextured, it gives the eye a bit of something to focus on. Bumping this up a point.</td>', 'This is an interesting idea. If your source image were a bit more recognizable (perhaps it is on the larger version?), it might be a bit stronger. Also, on a more subtle note, I''d consider leaving the whites of his eyes white and untextured, it gives the eye a bit of something to focus on. Bumping this up a point.', '2011-09-09 00:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6534145, 970591, 30861, '<td valign="top">Commenting only now, gave this a 9 earlier. I''m very taken with it, and hope you do well. The title sings to me.</td>', 'Commenting only now, gave this a 9 earlier. I''m very taken with it, and hope you do well. The title sings to me.', '2011-09-09 00:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6534151, 970603, 125275, '<td valign="top">I like this idea, although I might try a softer transition from to "hair." Using shadows to follow the contours of his face would add a bit more depth and realism.</td>', 'I like this idea, although I might try a softer transition from to "hair." Using shadows to follow the contours of his face would add a bit more depth and realism.', '2011-09-09 00:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
