(6534168, 970711, 125275, '<td valign="top">I like the pose, but my suggestion would be to have the subject wear a color other than black. It seems so much detail is lost it''s almost like he''s a floating head.</td>', 'I like the pose, but my suggestion would be to have the subject wear a color other than black. It seems so much detail is lost it''s almost like he''s a floating head.', '2011-09-09 00:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
