(6534202, 969472, 125275, '<td valign="top">This is a very in-your-face image. The title makes me feel like I should emphasize with him, but it''s hard because there is very little context in this tight crop. By itself it''s a good shot.</td>', 'This is a very in-your-face image. The title makes me feel like I should emphasize with him, but it''s hard because there is very little context in this tight crop. By itself it''s a good shot.', '2011-09-09 00:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
