(6534227, 970316, 136454, '<td valign="top">9 - nice job, why is he so board, the supermen are doing all of the work!!! Hey what is that guy doing at his neck? The more I look at this the more I like it!!</td>', '9 - nice job, why is he so board, the supermen are doing all of the work!!! Hey what is that guy doing at his neck? The more I look at this the more I like it!!', '2011-09-09 00:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
