(6534229, 969984, 136454, '<td valign="top">6- a little flat, maybe move flash off camera or natural light from the side instead of straight on</td>', '6- a little flat, maybe move flash off camera or natural light from the side instead of straight on', '2011-09-09 00:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
