(6534233, 969787, 136454, '<td valign="top">8 - very cool. At first I didn''t notice the faces</td>', '8 - very cool. At first I didn''t notice the faces', '2011-09-09 00:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6534234, 970722, 11769, '<td valign="top">Two sides to all of us.</td>', 'Two sides to all of us.', '2011-09-09 00:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6534235, 970719, 125275, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the lighting and color, but I feel this image could be improved by focus. The viewers eye will naturally move around a photograph, and as a photographer, you can control where that movement may be. This picture doesn''t give the eye anything to focus on and consequently, some strength is lost.</td>', 'I appreciate the lighting and color, but I feel this image could be improved by focus. The viewers eye will naturally move around a photograph, and as a photographer, you can control where that movement may be. This picture doesn''t give the eye anything to focus on and consequently, some strength is lost.', '2011-09-09 00:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6534237, 970618, 136454, '<td valign="top">5- his nose is lit, but it is darker under his eyes and around his mouth;I like the pose, environment and selective focus in background, but the lighting could be improved.</td>', '5- his nose is lit, but it is darker under his eyes and around his mouth;I like the pose, environment and selective focus in background, but the lighting could be improved.', '2011-09-09 00:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6534238, 970591, 11769, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image</td>', 'Beautiful image', '2011-09-09 00:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6534240, 970706, 11769, '<td valign="top">Raw nature</td>', 'Raw nature', '2011-09-09 00:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6534241, 970721, 136454, '<td valign="top">7  This is a great portrait, I love low key lighting and the eyes are so expressive; It is okay that the mouth is covered. It can be used as a sign of oppression. But I am not keen on the written message. The message is all in his eyes and should be interpreted by the viewer.</td>', '7  This is a great portrait, I love low key lighting and the eyes are so expressive; It is okay that the mouth is covered. It can be used as a sign of oppression. But I am not keen on the written message. The message is all in his eyes and should be interpreted by the viewer.', '2011-09-09 00:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6534242, 970668, 136454, '<td valign="top">8</td>', '8', '2011-09-09 00:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
