(6534414, 970721, 27108, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a great image!.. should have been higher ranked (gave you a 9), but so I think mine in the female portrait challenge that ended at 27! :P</td>', 'Congrats on a great image!.. should have been higher ranked (gave you a 9), but so I think mine in the female portrait challenge that ended at 27! :P', '2011-09-09 01:47:39.000000', NULL, 0),
