(6534421, 969984, 27108, '<td valign="top">Congrats on great entry!.. should have scored better indeed!.. (same as mine in female portrait challenge, ended at 27th!)</td>', 'Congrats on great entry!.. should have scored better indeed!.. (same as mine in female portrait challenge, ended at 27th!)', '2011-09-09 01:49:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(6534425, 970628, 48928, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the Blue, well deserved</td>', 'Congrats on the Blue, well deserved', '2011-09-09 01:51:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6534426, 970709, 119419, '<td valign="top">Well done Anita, better watch out if they become photographers ;)  Lovely series.</td>', 'Well done Anita, better watch out if they become photographers ;)  Lovely series.', '2011-09-09 01:51:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(6534427, 970670, 28742, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.kpriest.com/dpchallenge/gyaban_congrats.png'', strrpos(''//www.kpriest.com/dpchallenge/gyaban_congrats.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.kpriest.com/dpchallenge/gyaban_congrats.png"/> <br/>10 from me. Even more astounding reading your notes. Devotion!</td>', ' 10 from me. Even more astounding reading your notes. Devotion!', '2011-09-09 01:51:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(6534428, 970670, 65319, '<td valign="top">Although the strenuous effort of this image bears ribbon territory reward, frankly I find the effort to make friends with this image just as strenuous.  I would anticipate an image of hands to provide some sense of connection, but the primal almost stark darkness of expression disconnects me entirely.  I guess the lesson is that I don''t have to connect with this image to hail it as a remarkable and memorable experience.</td>', 'Although the strenuous effort of this image bears ribbon territory reward, frankly I find the effort to make friends with this image just as strenuous.  I would anticipate an image of hands to provide some sense of connection, but the primal almost stark darkness of expression disconnects me entirely.  I guess the lesson is that I don''t have to connect with this image to hail it as a remarkable and memorable experience.', '2011-09-09 01:53:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(6534430, 970628, 28742, '<td valign="top">Fantastic job, Justin! Yours and Christophe''s entries show that both simplicity and hours of meticulous work can both be appreciated. Well done!</td>', 'Fantastic job, Justin! Yours and Christophe''s entries show that both simplicity and hours of meticulous work can both be appreciated. Well done!', '2011-09-09 01:54:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6534432, 970094, 28742, '<td valign="top">Well done! Congratulations!</td>', 'Well done! Congratulations!', '2011-09-09 01:55:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6534433, 970587, 28742, '<td valign="top">Congrats! and thanks for posting the stages of editing gif - that is terrific!</td>', 'Congrats! and thanks for posting the stages of editing gif - that is terrific!', '2011-09-09 01:57:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(6534434, 970094, 114285, '<td valign="top">Not a surprise, I liked this one.</td>', 'Not a surprise, I liked this one.', '2011-09-09 01:57:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(6534435, 970628, 63812, '<td valign="top">Exellent work and lovely image. Very creative and simple. Congrats on your blue!</td>', 'Exellent work and lovely image. Very creative and simple. Congrats on your blue!', '2011-09-09 01:58:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6534436, 970670, 96751, '<td valign="top">I am always devastated by your creative genius and your extraordinary technical skills.  Brilliant, masterful work, Christophe.  Congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'I am always devastated by your creative genius and your extraordinary technical skills.  Brilliant, masterful work, Christophe.  Congrats on the ribbon.', '2011-09-09 01:58:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(6534437, 970316, 28742, '<td valign="top">Congrats on top ten! One of my fav''s.</td>', 'Congrats on top ten! One of my fav''s.', '2011-09-09 01:58:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6534438, 970674, 28742, '<td valign="top">One of my not-so-few 10s. Congrats on top ten!</td>', 'One of my not-so-few 10s. Congrats on top ten!', '2011-09-09 01:59:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(6534439, 970670, 135419, '<td valign="top">You are visionary.</td>', 'You are visionary.', '2011-09-09 01:59:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(6534440, 970670, 63812, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your ribbon! a new incredible, impressive image! wow!</td>', 'Congrats on your ribbon! a new incredible, impressive image! wow!', '2011-09-09 02:00:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(6534443, 969472, 28742, '<td valign="top">Very well done and I hope the portrait is appreciated and helps him through his grief.</td>', 'Very well done and I hope the portrait is appreciated and helps him through his grief.', '2011-09-09 02:02:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(6534444, 970094, 63812, '<td valign="top">Congratulations.  Nice job. Well done,Joey!</td>', 'Congratulations.  Nice job. Well done,Joey!', '2011-09-09 02:02:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(6534446, 970635, 28742, '<td valign="top">Great finish, Bear. I gave it a 7. A little too much on the digital art side for me. :P</td>', 'Great finish, Bear. I gave it a 7. A little too much on the digital art side for me. :P', '2011-09-09 02:03:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(6534447, 970587, 63812, '<td valign="top">Congrats on top 5! awesome work!</td>', 'Congrats on top 5! awesome work!', '2011-09-09 02:04:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(6534449, 969517, 68504, '<td valign="top">and this is what family viewing has come to...</td>', 'and this is what family viewing has come to...', '2011-09-09 02:06:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(6534450, 970670, 27133, '<td valign="top">Totally amazing.  Reminds me of my hands photo but yours is wayyyyyyyy better.  In my faves.</td>', 'Totally amazing.  Reminds me of my hands photo but yours is wayyyyyyyy better.  In my faves.', '2011-09-09 02:07:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(6534451, 969862, 28742, '<td valign="top">Got a 7 from me, Lydia. Great finish. Lots of entries like this that prove at least to me, that stunning, but straightforward photography can compete directly with digital art.</td>', 'Got a 7 from me, Lydia. Great finish. Lots of entries like this that prove at least to me, that stunning, but straightforward photography can compete directly with digital art.', '2011-09-09 02:07:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(6534452, 970338, 63812, '<td valign="top">I think you did a wonderful work! I voted 10..deserved to be on FP!</td>', 'I think you did a wonderful work! I voted 10..deserved to be on FP!', '2011-09-09 02:07:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(6534454, 970394, 68504, '<td valign="top">the gemini monger has been at it again.</td>', 'the gemini monger has been at it again.', '2011-09-09 02:10:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(6534457, 970743, 28742, '<td valign="top">LOL Jason. I gave it a 5. If you ditched the studio backlighting, you couldve blended a bit better. At least you entered something. I had some ideas, but no time.</td>', 'LOL Jason. I gave it a 5. If you ditched the studio backlighting, you couldve blended a bit better. At least you entered something. I had some ideas, but no time.', '2011-09-09 02:13:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(6534459, 969517, 28742, '<td valign="top">Robbed of the Brown. ...which would have been grossly appropriate. ;-)</td>', 'Robbed of the Brown. ...which would have been grossly appropriate. ;-)', '2011-09-09 02:15:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(6534468, 970670, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! Great work, Christophe. Thank you for your philosophizing. Well worth the read. We know where it''s all heading don''t we?</td>', 'Congratulations! Great work, Christophe. Thank you for your philosophizing. Well worth the read. We know where it''s all heading don''t we?', '2011-09-09 02:25:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(6534474, 970628, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! Self portrait, so double WOW!</td>', 'Congratulations! Self portrait, so double WOW!', '2011-09-09 02:28:37.000000', NULL, 0),
