(6535263, 970670, 60862, '<td valign="top">It''s not a great shock that you came up with yet another brilliant concept and then executed it so well.  You have proven yourself to be of incredible creativity and talent, and this is just the latest.<br/> <br/>But I''m very, very happy for you about this statement at the end of your comments: "I think this picture really sets a milestone in my work."<br/> <br/>I also like what you said about not taking up photography as a job.  While I''m nowhere near as talented, several friends have suggested the same to me, and I give them exactly the same answer.<br/> <br/>Felicitations!</td>', 'It''s not a great shock that you came up with yet another brilliant concept and then executed it so well.  You have proven yourself to be of incredible creativity and talent, and this is just the latest. But I''m very, very happy for you about this statement at the end of your comments: "I think this picture really sets a milestone in my work." I also like what you said about not taking up photography as a job.  While I''m nowhere near as talented, several friends have suggested the same to me, and I give them exactly the same answer. Felicitations!', '2011-09-10 00:47:52.000000', NULL, 0),
