(6538732, 970394, 108580, '<td valign="top">Damn Hermann what possessed you? OK well I typo''d the "guess the DPC clown" part but at last I stopped and looked twice before voting, unlike some. 6. As of now you are getting more views than 27th place, except for S<strike>k</strike>lippy''s cracking shot. Wonder how many red faces there are out there for not taking the time to look and just speed voting..</td>', 'Damn Hermann what possessed you? OK well I typo''d the "guess the DPC clown" part but at last I stopped and looked twice before voting, unlike some. 6. As of now you are getting more views than 27th place, except for Sklippy''s cracking shot. Wonder how many red faces there are out there for not taking the time to look and just speed voting..', '2011-09-13 19:13:04.000000', NULL, 0),
