(6539629, 970094, 97853, '<td valign="top">Nice work!</td>', 'Nice work!', '2011-09-14 11:14:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6539725, 969517, 86218, '<td valign="top">Why does it look like only the main subject was tonemapped? Everything else looks naturally processed?<br/>LOL. Lovely portrait and so much of reality in it that nobody can not laugh at this. Def not at the person''s expense but just at this pic depicting life as it is for all.</td>', 'Why does it look like only the main subject was tonemapped? Everything else looks naturally processed?LOL. Lovely portrait and so much of reality in it that nobody can not laugh at this. Def not at the person''s expense but just at this pic depicting life as it is for all.', '2011-09-14 12:47:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(6539744, 970709, 96751, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the bling, Anita!!!</td>', 'Congrats on the bling, Anita!!!', '2011-09-14 13:07:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6539952, 970670, 50695, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7. As someone who dabbles in the visual arts, I know the skill involved to create something like this. Also, I think it has a mood to it, which is a good thing. And it benefits from the simplicity that this format forced you into. Some of your work tends to get a bit... baroque.</td>', 'I gave this a 7. As someone who dabbles in the visual arts, I know the skill involved to create something like this. Also, I think it has a mood to it, which is a good thing. And it benefits from the simplicity that this format forced you into. Some of your work tends to get a bit... baroque.', '2011-09-14 16:52:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(6539983, 969517, 35357, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by RianBotes:</b></div><hr/><i> Why does it look like only the main subject was tonemapped? ... </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Because that''s what I did, good eye !</td>', 'Originally posted by RianBotes: Why does it look like only the main subject was tonemapped? ...  Because that''s what I did, good eye !', '2011-09-14 17:38:27.000000', NULL, 0),
